# W1-B keeps everything, as W1-A3/4/5 do. Nothing here is ignored.
#
# Tracked as evidence, exactly as the harness and grader leave them:
#   runs/F*/work_definition.json   the agent artifact, where one is produced
#   runs/F*/acp_transcript.jsonl   append-only ACP transcript, plus one "lifecycle"
#                                  record per canonical-block delivery
#   runs/F*/harness_result.json    outcome, COMPLETE reason, per-turn log with
#                                  block digests and continued-questioning counts,
#                                  controlled-input hashes before and after
#   RESULTS.md / RESULTS.json      the grader's record
